%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a shading in a collapsed CIE-based space. A CIEBasedABC
% dictionary with only its white point collapses to a calibrated RGB
% space; the shading carries that space, written inline, and its
% function's colours are the space's components.
gsave
100 600 300 80 rectclip
<< /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace [/CIEBasedABC << /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089] >>]
   /Coords [100 0 400 0]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0.9 0.2 0.1] /C1 [0.1 0.3 0.9] /N 1 >>
   /Extend [true true] >> shfill
grestore
showpage
